{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Introduction:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a clever liquid-measuring game ! Given a 5-liter cup and a 3-liter cup, how can you measure exactly 4 liters of water? You start with two empty cups and can perform three actions: fill a cup to the brim, empty it completely, or pour from one cup to the other until either the first cup is empty or the second is full. The game features <strong>103 carefully designed puzzles</strong> of increasing difficulty, challenging your problem-solving skills step by step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong><br><strong>Game Instruction:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Left-click to choose a cup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After select a cup , Right-click to pour water</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is nothing extra, only pure puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Euclid whispered this game idea in my dream (true story).</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3668790?t=1746154490","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668790/6b4a7df36858e32b1e77343ae6ccd934ae1de39e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746154490","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668790/0e423ffc8a3c31c763cb81ddad26b5d88b22ffc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746154490","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668790/0e423ffc8a3c31c763cb81ddad26b5d88b22ffc2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746154490","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3704950,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Introduction:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a clever liquid-measuring game ! Given a 5-liter cup and a 3-liter cup, how can you measu